abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline comparing seven regression models under three
  validation protocols on a one-year hourly co-location record of a low-cost
  metal-oxide gas sensor array, with protocol-matched nested hyperparameter
  search, a rolling-origin separation of deployment horizon from season, an
  assessment against the EU data-quality objectives, and replication on an
  independent 16-sensor array.
